## Create VM

- Virtual Network
  - VMnet2
  - Type: NAT
  - DHCP: enabled
  - Subnet: 192.168.10.0/24
  - Gateway: 192.168.10.2

- Master Node:
  - Hostname: controlplane
  - OS: Ubuntu 24.04 LTS
  - CPU: 4 vCPU
  - Memory: 4 GB
  - Disk: 40GB
  - IP: 192.168.10.180

- Worker Node 1:
  - Hostname: node01
  - OS: Ubuntu 24.04 LTS
  - CPU: 2 vCPU
  - Memory: 2 GB
  - Disk: 40GB
  - IP: 192.168.10.181

- Worker Node 2:
  - Hostname: node02
  - OS: Ubuntu 24.04 LTS
  - CPU: 2 vCPU
  - Memory: 2 GB
  - Disk: 40GB
  - IP: 192.168.10.182


